WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.295
- I went to all these amazing
dinners before the Oscars.

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:06.673
I met Danny Elfman who
said, "You’re gonna get it",

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.758
but still was unsure.

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:11.594
And whole of India 
was cheering.

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:13.263
I felt like a gladiator.

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.932
(gentle music)

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:20.729
- And the Oscar goes to 
A.R. Rahman,

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.938
(crowd cheers and claps)

00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:23.648
for "Slumdog Millionaire"

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:26.443
- When they announced
my name for the score,

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:30.196
I was like, "Is this
real or is it a dream?"

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:33.324
And because I had 
to perform next,

00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:35.118
I was like, “A.R, don't react.”

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:36.995
“Just be like the zen mode.”

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:39.080
“Don't mess up your performance.”

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.707
(camera clicks)

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.541
(camera clicks)

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.169
My speech was not prepared.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.795
I said, "I'll go with the flow."

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:48.339
Maximum I would say thank you and go off.

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:49.924
But when I was sitting there,

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:53.261
I was watching Penelope
Cruz speaking Spanish.

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:54.220
(speaking Spanish)

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.472
- Thank you so much.

00:00:55.472 --> 00:00:57.182
- Then I was like, 
"Oh, that's cool."

00:00:57.182 --> 00:00:59.893
I want to say something
in Tamil, which says,

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.186
(speaks Tamil).

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:04.439
That means, all perfect
praise belongs to God alone.

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:06.066
It is from a holy book.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.901
It's a promise from God.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:08.735
Thank you.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.820
That if you remember in 
the happy times,

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.822
I'll remember you in 
the sad times, so.

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:14.407
That is the happiest time 
of my own life

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:17.827
and I wanted to remember the
God who's common to all of us.

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:19.621
- And the Oscar goes to...

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:22.624
- A.R. Rahman and Gulzar 
for "Jai Ho".

00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:23.500
(crowd cheers and claps)

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.835
- The second time when
they announced my name

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:27.253
for the best song.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:29.547
The essence of the film
which is about optimism

00:01:29.547 --> 00:01:32.300
and the power of hope
in our lives.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.426
I had said in the speech

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:36.179
that the essence of the
film is optimism and hope

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:37.764
because the world 
was going through

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.891
that depression, 
economic depression

00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:42.477
and "Slumdog Millionaire"
was done in a way

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:45.355
that anybody who sees it would feel high.

00:01:45.355 --> 00:01:49.859
All my life I've had a
choice of hate and love.

00:01:49.859 --> 00:01:52.570
I chose love and I'm here. 
God bless.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:55.406
Some people have
misinterpreted that statement

00:01:55.406 --> 00:01:58.660
over some religion and this
and that, which is not true.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:01.204
This is the state of
every artist in the world

00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:03.498
and that's what makes 
them the artist.

00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:06.918
They want to give and love
is about giving, not taking.

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:12.090
After I got the Oscars, I
put it in my hand baggage

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.634
and the security, when
I was getting to India,

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.386
they said, "Can you wait?"

00:02:16.386 --> 00:02:20.473
And they were almost like 100
people in the security check.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.642
So the officer took 
these two Oscars.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:26.146
"Look what I have", and
everybody went gaga.

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:27.730
They were just, "Oh my God".

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:30.358
(gentle music)

